# Load path for test_card_vmu.py: the title's Continue into CLOAD loading the first VMU save into Home, then CARDA's New Save row below the loaded save (a second file, or Not enough Blocks on a full VMU).
wait state 2
wait 600
press DOWN 6
wait 30
press CROSS 6
wait state 7
wait 240
capture cload-list
press CROSS 6
wait 60
capture cload-prompt
press LEFT 6
wait 30
capture cload-prompt-yes
press CROSS 6
wait 600
capture cload-after
mash CROSS 40 marker field scene
wait 300
capture cload-loaded-field
open carda
wait 180
capture carda-second-list
press DOWN 6
wait 30
press CROSS 6
wait 60
press LEFT 6
wait 30
capture carda-second-prompt
press CROSS 6
wait 900
capture carda-second-saved
